design\releases\0_3_0\F_182_move_context_size_to_below_chatlog.md:22:`ActionConversationChat` owns the scrollable transcript and appends the status and `ConversationTimer` inside that scroll area. It hides both status and timer when popup run status is `idle`, so a completed selected conversation has no visible duration. `ActionConversationChatOwner` already supplies the live conversation or selected persisted conversation, so the chat boundary has the data needed for both duration and context occupancy.
